
Standard attributes (in the language):

[[noreturn]], [[likely]], [[unlikely]], [[assume(expr)]]


Attributes common to gcc, clang, and msvc:

[[nodiscard]]
[[maybe_unused]]
[[deprecated]]/[[deprecated("this is deprecated (arbitrary warning msg")]]
[[fallthrough]]

Misc:
[gnu::always_inline]] or [[gnu::noinline]]
[[msvc::forceinline]]
[[gnu::format(printf, string_index, first_to_check_index)]]
[[gnu::pure]]
[[gnu::const]]
[[gnu::packed]] or [[gnu::aligned(X)]]
[[msvc::options(pack(X))]]


# common pracice:
#if defined(__clang__)
    #define FORCE_INLINE [[clang::always_inline]]
#elif defined(__GNUC__)
    #define FORCE_INLINE [[gnu::always_inline]]
#elif defined(_MSC_VER)
    #define FORCE_INLINE [[msvc::forceinline]]
#else
    #define FORCE_INLINE
#endif
